---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
interface Props { lang?: 'en' | 'vi' }
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const L = (en: string, vi: string) => (lang === 'vi' ? vi : en);
const W = 900;
const H = 284;
---
<figure class="dal">
  <div class="dal-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label={L("A client sends bytes. The server's kernel buffers them and returns a TCP ACK. The application crashed before reading, so the work never ran even though the client got an ACK.", "Client gửi byte. Kernel của server giữ chúng và trả TCP ACK. Ứng dụng đã sập trước khi đọc, nên việc không hề chạy dù client nhận được ACK.")}>
<text x="20" y="24" class="t-h">{L("A TCP ACK comes from the kernel, not from your application","TCP ACK đến từ kernel, không phải từ ứng dụng của bên kia")}</text>
<rect x="20" y="76" width="150" height="110" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={95} y={110} size={34} />
<text x="95" y="160" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("Client","Client")}</text>
<rect x="330" y="46" width="550" height="196" rx="8" class="box-d" />
<DiagramIcon name="server" x={362} y={70} size={26} />
<text x="384" y="75" class="t-b">{L("Server","Server")}</text>
<rect x="350" y="92" width="210" height="130" rx="6" class="box-g" />
<text x="455" y="120" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("Operating system kernel","Kernel hệ điều hành")}</text>
<text x="455" y="142" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("receive buffer now holds","bộ đệm nhận đã giữ")}</text>
<text x="455" y="158" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("the bytes","các byte đó")}</text>
<DiagramIcon name="ok" x={455} y={192} size={24} />
<rect x="660" y="92" width="200" height="130" rx="6" class="box-r" />
<DiagramIcon name="fail" x={760} y={122} size={26} />
<text x="760" y="158" class="t-r" text-anchor="middle">{L("Application","Ứng dụng")}</text>
<text x="760" y="176" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("crashed before","đã sập trước khi")}</text>
<text x="760" y="192" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("it called read()","kịp gọi read()")}</text>
<path d="M 170 112 L 344.0 112.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="350,112 342.8,115.5 342.8,108.5" class="hd" />
<text x="260" y="104" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("1. send bytes","1. gửi byte")}</text>
<path d="M 350 160 L 176.0 160.0" class="ln-g" /><polygon points="170,160 177.2,156.5 177.2,163.5" class="hd-g" />
<text x="260" y="180" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">{L("2. TCP ACK: got it","2. TCP ACK: đã nhận")}</text>
<path d="M 560 157 L 648.0 157.0" class="ln-rd" /><polygon points="654,157 646.8,160.5 646.8,153.5" class="hd-r" />
<path d="M 601 151 L 613 163 M 601 163 L 613 151" class="ln-r" />
<text x="607" y="140" class="t-m" text-anchor="middle">{L("3. read()","3. read()")}</text>
<text x="20" y="266" class="t-m">{L("The ACK proves the kernel has the bytes. Only a reply from the application proves the work ran.","ACK chỉ chứng minh kernel đã giữ byte. Chỉ phản hồi từ ứng dụng mới chứng minh việc đã chạy.")}</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>{L("Two different layers answer. Treat the ACK as 'delivered to the machine', never as 'done'.", "Có hai tầng khác nhau trả lời. Hãy coi ACK là 'đã tới máy', đừng bao giờ coi là 'đã xong'.")}</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dal { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dal-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dal svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dal text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dal .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dal .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dal .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dal .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dal .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dal .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dal .box-g { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dal .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dal .box-gd { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dal .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dal .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dal .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dal .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dal .ln-rd { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dal .ln-gr { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dal .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dal .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dal .hd-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dal .dot-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dal figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
